==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Shellder}}.
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Sun & Moon|Shellder|33}} from the {{TCG|Sun & Moon}} expansion; both cards have the Tackle attack.
*{{m|Tackle}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Shellder}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

